  vendorName: Chef DuPont
  offerText: I am taking over your quarters to prepare a massive banquet for my clients.
    It will cost you all your space, and you cannot eat a single bite of it.
  acceptResultText: He clutters your room and you suffer the agonizing smell of food
    you can't have. However, he accidentally leaves his hefty tip jar behind when
    he leaves!
  rejectResultText: You throw the chef out. You make yourself a basic sandwich in
    your clean kitchen, feeling satisfied.
